# Host state that git ignores stays out of the build context: dependencies, build and test output,
# generated files and env files. Dependencies come from the deps stage, and `bun run build`
# regenerates locales/namespaces, public/sw.js and .next.
#
# BuildKit applies this file to myrm-agent-frontend/Dockerfile. The context is the myrm-agent/ root
# that the backend image shares, so the frontend rules carry the myrm-agent-frontend/ prefix.
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
myrm-agent-frontend/.next
myrm-agent-frontend/.next-*
myrm-agent-frontend/coverage
myrm-agent-frontend/locales/namespaces
myrm-agent-frontend/public/sw.js
myrm-agent-frontend/*.tsbuildinfo
myrm-agent-frontend/next-env.d.ts

# NEXT_PUBLIC_* values in env files are inlined into the client bundle at build time; the image
# takes its settings from build args instead.
myrm-agent-frontend/.env*
